1
00:00:00,132 --> 00:00:03,112
(Sheldon:)...it's my bedtime, so whatever
gets you out the door. Good night.

2
00:00:08,107 --> 00:00:09,207
(Bernadette:)Howie, I'm back!

3
00:00:10,243 --> 00:00:11,483
(Howard:)I just got her to sleep.

4
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:12,784
(Howard:)Sorry.

5
00:00:12,945 --> 00:00:15,485
(Howard:)What took you so long?
The grocery store's a few blocks away.

6
00:00:15,648 --> 00:00:17,928
They only had regular yogurt.
I had to go to a different store

7
00:00:18,084 --> 00:00:20,584
(Bernadette:)to get the extra-fat kind
your mom likes.

8
00:00:21,754 --> 00:00:23,754
(Howard:)Then why do I smell coffee
on your breath?

9
00:00:23,923 --> 00:00:26,403
(Bernadette:)So what? After two days
of taking care of her,

10
00:00:26,559 --> 00:00:28,469
(Bernadette:)excuse me for stopping
to get a mocha.

11
00:00:28,628 --> 00:00:32,638
(Howard:)A mocha?
Well, it must be nice to be queen.

12
00:00:33,633 --> 00:00:36,083
(Bernadette:)Queen?
I've been killing myself here!

13
00:00:36,235 --> 00:00:38,115
(Howard:)Well, whose fault is that? I wanted
to get a nurse, but you were all,

14
00:00:38,271 --> 00:00:41,011
"I'm nice. I want to take care of people."

15
00:00:43,309 --> 00:00:46,689
(Bernadette:)I'm glad I got that mocha.
And you know what else I'm glad about?

16
00:00:46,846 --> 00:00:50,756
(Bernadette:)I bought you a brownie
and I ate it in the car!

17
00:00:53,252 --> 00:00:56,032
Howard!

18
00:00:56,188 --> 00:01:07,028
(Howard:)Thanks a lot.
Now I have to go rub her belly again.

